pattern names and 940 line families from user-supplied YTKC legacy ZWCAD.PAT
definitions. On 2026-10-03, the contributing user explicitly confirmed the
right to publicly redistribute the complete pattern resource and authorized
its publication. Names, descriptions, and numeric PAT definitions are retained
without semantic substitutions. This statement records the user's resource
authorization; it does not claim authorization or endorsement by a CAD software
vendor, nor does it redistribute the legacy software or private drawings.
The resource provenance and exact SHA-256 digests are exported by
src/knowledge-packs/geology-patterns.js. The symbols are drawing resources,
not verified geological classifications or a claim of universal standards.
